Bypass Tel URI Filter
At least 2 RFC mention the ;phone-context= descriptor:

RFC3966 - The tel URI for Telephone Numbers
RFC2806 - URLs for Telephone Calls
+330011223344;phone-context=<script>alert(0)</script>
